\tag{fdip}
\title{The integral Hurwitz form and its reductions}
\date{2026-11-17}

\p{The Hurwitz lattice carries the left action of its
#{24} norm-one units. An integral alternating form on that
lattice supplies the [kernel-form criterion](fdip-00UV)
for the coupled cochain operator. Its explicit Gram matrix
also permits reduction at primes where averaging over the
group is unavailable.}

